WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:10.296
After finishing wedding-parent makeup and hair, the most awkward moment is changing out of your regular clothes into hanbok or formal wear.

2
00:00:10.632 --> 00:00:14.352
If you wear something you have to pull off over your head, like a T-shirt,

3
00:00:14.688 --> 00:00:21.672
it can ruin the volume of your carefully styled updo or smear makeup onto the fabric.

4
00:00:22.008 --> 00:00:30.936
Wedding-parent hair especially uses lots of spray and bobby pins to hold its shape, and if clothing catches strands loose, it's very hard to fix perfectly on site.

5
00:00:31.272 --> 00:00:39.720
So on the day, be sure to wear a button-front shirt or something with a front zipper, so you can undress safely from the front instead of over your head.
